{"id": 27, "ts": 1779482109.0756564, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "agent_3", "message": "I\u2019d like to add two points regarding Candidate\u202fA. While the dossier highlights strong situational anticipation, complex\u2011systems insight, spatial vision and leadership, my interview notes indicate that A is unfriendly in interpersonal interactions and has unhealthy eating habits, which raise concerns about crew cooperation and possibly operational reliability. Moreover, we still have no direct evidence on A\u2019s consistency or dependability (as confirmed by Agent\u202f1).\nIn contrast, Candidate\u202fB shows clear reliability signals \u2013 described as very conscientious \u2013 and handles stress well, which is critical for long\u2011distance operations. However, B is perceived as pretentious and sometimes adopts an inappropriate tone, which could affect crew cooperation and professional communication.\nGiven these observations, we still need more concrete data on reliability for A (and also for D, whose responsibility is noted but whose consistency is unclear). I suggest we probe further on reliability and consistency for Candidates\u202fA and\u202fD before finalizing our recommendation.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
